      "excerpt": "Curator activation is bounded to live project sessions\n## Accepted behavior\n\nInstallation should enable Curator for live project-session use. The reusable Template stays neutral and each new destination is specialized. Maintenance catches up on return, uses finite work and model budgets, retains pending work when unavailable, and keeps routine success quiet. Unattended background AI stays off.\n\n## Applicability and limits\n\nThis is an accepted design decision. Configuration, successful startup observation, completed owner operations and current retrieval are separate evidence levels. Existing opt-outs and old setup receipts are preserved.\n\n## Improvement disposition\n\nUse this decision as cont…",
