      "excerpt": "…canonical Task tree\n## Observation\n\nA normal final Task event exceeded the current publication inventory bound after incidental command output accumulated under the Task directory. Moving 63 uncited raw stdout/stderr files into the assigned Verification evidence scope preserved all 53 canonical Task/response files. The exact same event payload then succeeded.\n\n## Evidence\n\nThe retained verification receipt binds the relocation manifest, independent 63-file comparison and actual recorded event result. No owner limit or implementation was changed.\n\n## Lesson and applicability\n\nKeep future raw command output and transient event-input logs in the assigned Verification scope. Keep only canonical …",
